      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Member election for additional members Part VI line 7a</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Elected officers shall be elected by written ballot or by majority vote at the annual meeting of the lodge.</ExplanationTxt>
